  "SurveyEntry": {
    "SurveyID": "SV_tIgKkb1utmeDfld",
    "SurveyName": "Rich text in every field",
    "SurveyDescription": "planning/rich-text.md §3 (task RT2): the rich-text model end to end. Block fields (a note, the consent text, the end message) carry headings and lists; stems (labels, help) carry marks, links and pipes; inline fields (choice, row and column labels, slider end labels, the page title, the constraint message, the consent buttons) carry one paragraph. Pipes sit inside formatting. Arabic is a second language with a rich RTL label; one label has no Arabic and falls back.",
